#: of pyvista.core.filters.data_object.DataObjectFilters.extract_surface:29
msgid ""
"If ``0``, the output is the equivalent to its linear counterpart (and the "
"midpoints determining the non-linear interpolation are discarded). If ``1`` "
"(the default), the non-linear face is triangulated based on the midpoints. "
"If greater than ``1``, the triangulated pieces are recursively subdivided to"
" reach the desired subdivision. Setting the value to greater than ``1`` may "
"cause some point data to not be passed even if no nonlinear faces exist."
