#: ../../pyvista/doc/source/api/core/_autosummary/pyvista.Light.attenuation_values.rst:2
msgid "Light.attenuation\\_values"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../../../../opt/hostedtoolcache/Python/3.13.14/x64/lib/python3.13/site-packages/pyvista/plotting/lights.pydocstring
#: of pyvista.Light.attenuation_values:4
msgid ""
"The values are 3-length sequences which specify the constant, linear and "
"quadratic constants in this order. These parameters only have an effect for "
"positional lights."
msgstr "値は3つの長さのシーケンスで，この順序で定数，1次定数，2次定数を指定します．これらのパラメータは，ポジションライトにのみ影響します．"

#: ../../../../../../../opt/hostedtoolcache/Python/3.13.14/x64/lib/python3.13/site-packages/pyvista/plotting/lights.pydocstring
#: of pyvista.Light.attenuation_values:8
msgid ""
"Attenuation refers to the dampening of a beam of light as it gets further "
"away from the point source. The three constants describe three different "
"profiles for dampening with distance. A larger attenuation constant "
"corresponds to more rapid decay with distance."
msgstr ""
"減衰とは，ポイントソースから遠ざかるにつれてライトのビームが減衰することです．3つの定数は，距離による減衰のための3つの異なるプロファイルを記述します．減衰定数が大きいほど，距離とともに減衰が速くなります．"

#: ../../../../../../../opt/hostedtoolcache/Python/3.13.14/x64/lib/python3.13/site-packages/pyvista/plotting/lights.pydocstring
#: of pyvista.Light.attenuation_values:28
msgid ":ref:`attenuation_example`"
msgstr ":ref:`attenuation_example`"

#: ../../pyvista/doc/source/api/core/_autosummary/pyvista.Light.attenuation_values.rst:6
msgid ""
"Plot three cubes lit by two lights with different attenuation profiles.  The"
" blue light has slower linear attenuation, the green one has quadratic "
"attenuation that makes it decay faster. Note that there are no shadow "
"effects included so each box gets lit by both lights."
msgstr ""
"異なる減衰プロファイルを持つ2つのライトで照らされた3つの立方体をプロットします．青のライトは線形減衰が遅く，緑のライトは2次減衰が速くなります．シャドウエフェクトは含まれていないため，各ボックスは両方のライトで照らされます．"

#: ../../pyvista/doc/source/api/core/_autosummary/pyvista.Light.cone_angle.rst:2
msgid "Light.cone\\_angle"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../../../../opt/hostedtoolcache/Python/3.13.14/x64/lib/python3.13/site-packages/pyvista/plotting/lights.pydocstring
#: of pyvista.Light.cone_angle:4
msgid ""
"The angle is in degrees and is measured between the axis of the cone and an "
"extremal ray of the cone. A value smaller than 90 has spot lighting effects,"
" anything equal to and above 90 is just a positional light, i.e. a spherical"
" point source."
msgstr ""
"角度は度単位で，円錐の軸と円錐の極値光線の間で測定されます．値が90より小さい場合はスポットライト効果があり，90以上の値は単なる位置ライト，つまり球状のポイントソースになります．"

#: ../../../../../../../opt/hostedtoolcache/Python/3.13.14/x64/lib/python3.13/site-packages/pyvista/plotting/lights.pydocstring
#: of pyvista.Light.cone_angle:9
msgid ""
"Regarding the angular distribution of the light, the cone angle merely "
"truncates the beam, the shape of which is defined by the "
":py:attr:`exponent`.  If the cone angle is at least 90 degrees then there is"
" no angular dependence."
msgstr ""
"光の角度分布に関しては，円錐角は単にビームを打ち切るだけであり，その形状は :py:attr:`exponent` "
"によって定義される．円錐角が少なくとも90度であれば，角度依存性はない．"

#: ../../../../../../../opt/hostedtoolcache/Python/3.13.14/x64/lib/python3.13/site-packages/pyvista/plotting/lights.pydocstring
#: of pyvista.Light.cone_angle:14
msgid ""
"If the light's cone angle is increased to 90 degrees or above, its actor (if"
" previously shown) is automatically hidden."
msgstr "ライトの円錐角度を90度以上にすると，そのアクター(以前に表示された場合)が自動的に非表示になります．"

#: ../../../../../../../opt/hostedtoolcache/Python/3.13.14/x64/lib/python3.13/site-packages/pyvista/plotting/lights.pydocstring
#: of pyvista.Light.cone_angle:31
msgid ":ref:`beam_shape_example`"
msgstr ":ref:`beam_shape_example`"

#: ../../pyvista/doc/source/api/core/_autosummary/pyvista.Light.cone_angle.rst:6
msgid ""
"Plot three planes lit by three spotlights with varying cone angles.  Use a "
"large exponent to cause a visible angular variation of the intensity of the "
"beams."
msgstr ""
"3つのスポットライトで照らされた3つの平面を，さまざまな円錐角度でプロットします．大きな指数を使用すると，ビーム強度の角度変化が目に見えるようになります．"

