msgid ""
"This is helpful when generating surfaces from point clouds and is more "
"reliable than :func:`DataSetFilters.delaunay_3d`."
msgstr ""
"これは点群からサーフェスを生成するときに便利で， :func:`DataSetFilters.delaunay_3d` よりも信頼性が高いです．"

#: ../../../../../../../opt/hostedtoolcache/Python/3.13.14/x64/lib/python3.13/site-packages/pyvista/core/filters/poly_data.pydocstring
