"More specifically, ``PartitionedDataSet`` is a "
":class:`collections.abc.MutableSequence` and supports operations such as "
"append, insert, etc."
msgstr ""
"具体的には、 ``PartitionedDataSet`` は :class:`collections.abc.MutableSequence` "
"で、追加や挿入などの操作をサポートする。"

#: ../../pyvista/doc/source/api/core/partitioned.rst:66
