msgstr ""

#: ../../pyvista/doc/source/api/readers/index.rst:114
msgid ""
"When :func:`pyvista.read` is given a remote URI (``https://``, ``s3://``, "
"etc.) and a custom reader is registered for the file extension, the URI is "
"passed directly to the reader.  If the reader raises "
":class:`~pyvista.LocalFileRequiredError`, PyVista downloads the file to a "
"temporary local path and retries.  For built-in formats with no custom "
"reader, the download happens automatically. This uses ``fsspec`` when "
"available (install with ``pip install pyvista[io]``), falling back to "
"``pooch`` for HTTP(S) URIs."
msgstr ""

