msgstr "perlin\\_noise"

#: ../../../../../../../opt/hostedtoolcache/Python/3.13.14/x64/lib/python3.13/site-packages/pyvista/core/utilities/features.pydocstring
#: of pyvista.core.utilities.features.perlin_noise:4
msgid ""
"Uses :vtk:`vtkPerlinNoise` and computes a Perlin noise field as an implicit "
"function. :vtk:`vtkPerlinNoise` is a concrete implementation of "
":vtk:`vtkImplicitFunction`. Perlin noise, originally described by Ken "
"Perlin, is a non-periodic and continuous noise function useful for modeling "
"real-world objects."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../../../../opt/hostedtoolcache/Python/3.13.14/x64/lib/python3.13/site-packages/pyvista/core/utilities/features.pydocstring
#: of pyvista.core.utilities.features.perlin_noise:10
msgid ""
"The amplitude and frequency of the noise pattern are adjustable. This "
"implementation of Perlin noise is derived closely from Greg Ward's version "
"in Graphics Gems II."
msgstr ""
"ノイズパターンの振幅と周波数は調整可能です．このPerlinノイズの実装は，Graphics Gems IIのGreg "
"Wardのバージョンから密接に派生したものです．"

#: ../../../../../../../opt/hostedtoolcache/Python/3.13.14/x64/lib/python3.13/site-packages/pyvista/core/utilities/features.pydocstring
#: of pyvista.core.utilities.features.perlin_noise:17
msgid "Amplitude of the noise function."
msgstr "ノイズ関数の振幅．"

#: ../../../../../../../opt/hostedtoolcache/Python/3.13.14/x64/lib/python3.13/site-packages/pyvista/core/utilities/features.pydocstring
#: of pyvista.core.utilities.features.perlin_noise:19
msgid ""
"``amplitude`` can be negative. The noise function varies randomly between "
"``-|Amplitude|`` and ``|Amplitude|``. Therefore the range of values is "
"``2*|Amplitude|`` large. The initial amplitude is 1."
msgstr ""
"振幅 ``amplitude`` は負になることがある．ノイズ関数は ``-|Amplitude|`` と ``|Amplitude|`` "
"の間でランダムに変化します．したがって，値の範囲は ``2*|Amplitude|`` と大きくなっています．初期振幅は1です．"

#: ../../../../../../../opt/hostedtoolcache/Python/3.13.14/x64/lib/python3.13/site-packages/pyvista/core/utilities/features.pydocstring
#: of pyvista.core.utilities.features.perlin_noise:24
msgid "**freq** : :term:`python:sequence`\\[:class:`python:float`]"
msgstr "**freq** : :term:`python:sequence`\\[:class:`python:float`]"

#: ../../../../../../../opt/hostedtoolcache/Python/3.13.14/x64/lib/python3.13/site-packages/pyvista/core/utilities/features.pydocstring
#: of pyvista.core.utilities.features.perlin_noise:25
msgid ""
"The frequency, or physical scale, of the noise function (higher is finer "
"scale)."
msgstr "ノイズ関数の周波数，または物理的なスケール（高いほど細かいスケール）．"

#: ../../../../../../../opt/hostedtoolcache/Python/3.13.14/x64/lib/python3.13/site-packages/pyvista/core/utilities/features.pydocstring
#: of pyvista.core.utilities.features.perlin_noise:28
msgid "The frequency can be adjusted per axis, or the same for all axes."
msgstr "周波数は，軸ごとに調整することも，全軸で同じにすることも可能です．"

#: ../../../../../../../opt/hostedtoolcache/Python/3.13.14/x64/lib/python3.13/site-packages/pyvista/core/utilities/features.pydocstring
#: of pyvista.core.utilities.features.perlin_noise:30
msgid "**phase** : :term:`python:sequence`\\[:class:`python:float`]"
msgstr "**phase** : :term:`python:sequence`\\[:class:`python:float`]"

#: ../../../../../../../opt/hostedtoolcache/Python/3.13.14/x64/lib/python3.13/site-packages/pyvista/core/utilities/features.pydocstring
#: of pyvista.core.utilities.features.perlin_noise:31
msgid "Set/get the phase of the noise function."
msgstr "ノイズ関数の位相を設定／返します．"

#: ../../../../../../../opt/hostedtoolcache/Python/3.13.14/x64/lib/python3.13/site-packages/pyvista/core/utilities/features.pydocstring
#: of pyvista.core.utilities.features.perlin_noise:33
msgid ""
"This parameter can be used to shift the noise function within space (perhaps"
" to avoid a beat with a noise pattern at another scale). Phase tends to "
"repeat about every unit, so a phase of 0.5 is a half-cycle shift."
msgstr ""
"このパラメータは，空間内でノイズ関数をシフトさせるために使用することができます（おそらく，別のスケールのノイズパターンとのビートを避けるため）．位相は約単位ごとに繰り返す傾向があるので，0.5の位相は半周期のシフトとなります．"

